{"parse":{"title":"角色印象卡：萨曼莎","pageid":3079,"revid":6618,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E8%90%A8%E6%9B%BC%E8%8E%8E&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E8%90%A8%E6%9B%BC%E8%8E%8E&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E8%90%A8%E6%9B%BC%E8%8E%8E&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF\" title=\"官方消息\">官方消息</a>&gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E7%A7%91%E6%99%AE\" title=\"科普\">科普</a> &gt; <b>角色印象卡：萨曼莎</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h1><span id=\".E8.A7.92.E8.89.B2.E5.8D.B0.E8.B1.A1.E5.8D.A1.7C.E8.90.A8.E6.9B.BC.E8.8E.8E\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"角色印象卡|萨曼莎\">角色印象卡|萨曼莎</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A1%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%9A%E8%90%A8%E6%9B%BC%E8%8E%8E&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"编辑章节：角色印象卡|萨曼莎\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h1>\n<div class=\"sidebar-card\" style=\"margin:15px 0px\"><b>本文来自</b>：官方微信公众号<br /><b>原作者</b>：开预约的小场记<br /><b>发布时间</b>：2023-08-21 18:03<br /><b>原视频/文章地址</b>：<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"http://game.bilibili.com/linkfilter/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2Fs%2FGKW57RBCdxoMie7NbNTNyg\" target=\"_blank\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GKW57RBCdxoMie7NbNTNyg</a></div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<p><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息139.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png/560px-%E5%AE%98%E6%96%B9%E6%B6%88%E6%81%AF139.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/c/c7/72xafugk93306ku2kwk2w8puptbju7z.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"750\" data-file-height=\"120\" />\n<br /><br />\n</p>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">人物介绍</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n<p>圣洁且善良，怀有<font color=\"brown\"><b>救世与慈悲之心</b></font>的修女萨曼莎，是<font color=\"brown\"><b>庇护之光</b></font>虔诚的信仰者。 <br />\n萨曼莎是来自<font color=\"brown\"><b>法皇国</b></font>的光辉侍者，以<font color=\"brown\"><b>救助世人、普渡众生</b></font>的愿景来到伊利亚的庇护所主持活动。浪涌城事件后，萨曼莎前往到了距浪涌城最近的<font color=\"brown\"><b>铃兰小镇</b></font>，用自己的力量倾力救助难民。<br />\n给予了无数人帮助的萨曼莎<font color=\"brown\"><b>不会索求任何回报</b></font>，一切的动力都源自她那颗<font color=\"brown\"><b>热爱奉献</b></font>的内心。<br /><br />\n<img alt=\"官方消息174.jpg\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/8/82/90igkp8sofxcj4nac0hy2ql62nfkdxm.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1920\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1920\" /><br /><br />\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022163727\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 107/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2014/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 274/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   30.420      1 -total\n 49.85%   15.165      1 模板:面包屑\n 49.83%   15.158      1 模板:文章戳\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:3079-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022163727 and revision id 6618. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"科普","missing":true}],"images":["官方消息139.png","官方消息174.jpg"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"1","line":"角色印象卡|萨曼莎","number":"1","index":"1","fromtitle":"角色印象卡：萨曼莎","byteoffset":16,"anchor":"角色印象卡|萨曼莎"}],"displaytitle":"角色印象卡：萨曼莎","wikitext":"{{面包屑|官方消息|科普}}\n=角色印象卡|萨曼莎=\n{{文章戳\n|文章上级页面=科普\n|时间=2023-08-21 18:03\n|作者=开预约的小场记\n|是否原创=否\n|来源=官方微信公众号\n|原文地址=https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/GKW57RBCdxoMie7NbNTNyg\n}}\n\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\" style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\">\n<br>\n[[file:官方消息139.png|560px|link=]]\n<br><br>\n<div style=\"margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center; visibility: visible;\" powered-by=\"xiumi.us\">\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; padding-left: 6px; padding-right: 6px; font-size: 17px; visibility: visible;\"><p style=\"visibility: visible;\"><strong style=\"visibility: visible;\">人物介绍</strong></p></div>\n<div style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; width: 10px; visibility: visible;\">\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; margin-left: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div>\n<div style=\"width: 5px; height: 5px; background-color: rgb(218, 203, 158); visibility: visible;\"></div></div></div>\n圣洁且善良，怀有<font color=brown>'''救世与慈悲之心'''</font>的修女萨曼莎，是<font color=brown>'''庇护之光'''</font>虔诚的信仰者。 <br>\n萨曼莎是来自<font color=brown>'''法皇国'''</font>的光辉侍者，以<font color=brown>'''救助世人、普渡众生'''</font>的愿景来到伊利亚的庇护所主持活动。浪涌城事件后，萨曼莎前往到了距浪涌城最近的<font color=brown>'''铃兰小镇'''</font>，用自己的力量倾力救助难民。<br>\n给予了无数人帮助的萨曼莎<font color=brown>'''不会索求任何回报'''</font>，一切的动力都源自她那颗<font color=brown>'''热爱奉献'''</font>的内心。<br><br>\n[[File:官方消息174.jpg|link=]]<br><br>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\"></div>\n</div>"},"capturedAt":"2026-10-22T16:37:27.817125+00:00"}